    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'endPhrases.Array.data[0]'
      value: What a wonderful job!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'endPhrases.Array.data[1]'
      value: Now that you showed your skills by comparing all this fractions, I'm impressed with your knowledge.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'endPhrases.Array.data[2]'
      value: I feel you deserve to become my star assistant for now on.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'endPhrases.Array.data[3]'
      value: For example, we could represent 2/4 as 1/2 or 4/8. When we simplify the initial fraction, we can see that 2/4 is 1/2, and 4/8 is 1/2, so they all are equivalents.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: congratPhrases.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introPhrases.Array.data[0]'
      value: Good work! You are almost an expert analyzing fractions of desserts and cakes.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introPhrases.Array.data[1]'
      value: Thank you for helping me with the first two tasks.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introPhrases.Array.data[2]'
      value: For this step, we will do a final check to the orders that will be delivered so you must pay attention to the questions so we can confirm the order is fine.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introPhrases.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Let\u2019s put your skills in test once more."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introPhrases.Array.data[4]'
      value: So now, I'll tell you the equivalence of a fraction, then you will drag the pieces of bread that you think are the equivalent and confirm by clicking the check button.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introPhrases.Array.data[5]'
      value: Let's try it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'congratPhrases.Array.data[0]'
      value: Incredible!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'congratPhrases.Array.data[1]'
      value: You are correct!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'congratPhrases.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'If we want to have a better understanding we check their denominators and find that they are not comparable. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'congratPhrases.Array.data[3]'
      value: We convert 1/2 to a comparable fraction by multiplying it with a number in the denominator and numerator.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'congratPhrases.Array.data[4]'
      value: That's how we got a fraction that is equals to 1/2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8226921903920718117, guid: e89103e4eb1139d4093dc511d0cfd54f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'congratPhrases.Array.data[5]'
      value: Let's continue.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
